  "description": "Per-project consumer lag against shared-stream position. Operators consult this dashboard to spot the lag-isolation trigger from docs/architecture/03-rabbitmq-streams.md (a project's primary consumer cannot keep up with shared-stream position and is dragging end-to-end lag SLOs for unrelated projects). The lag panel splits by project_id; a per-project end-to-end lag gauge surfaces the last observation for quick alerting reference.",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Per-project consumer lag against shared-stream position\n\nUses the Polaris topic-family labels `project_id`, `environment`, `topic_family`, `concrete_topic`, `partition`. The `polaris_processor_lag_ms_last` gauge is emitted by the shared processor metrics registry per partition.\n\n- Sustained lag growth on one project across multiple consumer pods is the lag-isolation trigger documented in `docs/architecture/03-rabbitmq-streams.md`.\n- Use `polaris topics isolate --project <id> --env <env> --family <name>` once the trigger has persisted for one operational review cycle.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5 },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (project_id) (polaris_processor_lag_ms_last{topic_family=\"$topic_family\", environment=\"$environment\", concrete_topic=\"$topic_family\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{project_id}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Max per-project lag against shared-topic partitions",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 10000 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 60000 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (project_id, processor_name) (polaris_processor_lag_ms_last{topic_family=\"$topic_family\", environment=\"$environment\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{project_id}} - {{processor_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Latest per-project per-processor lag",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
